{"componentChunkName":"component---src-layouts-blog-post-js","path":"/blog/taking-a-break","result":{"data":{"post":{"title":"Taking a break","caption":"If you can even call it that...","featuredImage":{"title":"Man sleeping","description":"","fluid":{"base64":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","aspectRatio":1.3656918902622852,"src":"//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/679XxlbqAe2s4xWAG1oXse/211a4fa7f9eebce0d2aef01c3e727a53/sleeping.jpg?w=3000&q=50","srcSet":"//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/679XxlbqAe2s4xWAG1oXse/211a4fa7f9eebce0d2aef01c3e727a53/sleeping.jpg?w=750&h=549&q=50 750w,\n//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/679XxlbqAe2s4xWAG1oXse/211a4fa7f9eebce0d2aef01c3e727a53/sleeping.jpg?w=1500&h=1098&q=50 1500w,\n//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/679XxlbqAe2s4xWAG1oXse/211a4fa7f9eebce0d2aef01c3e727a53/sleeping.jpg?w=3000&h=2197&q=50 3000w","srcWebp":"//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/679XxlbqAe2s4xWAG1oXse/211a4fa7f9eebce0d2aef01c3e727a53/sleeping.jpg?w=3000&q=50&fm=webp","srcSetWebp":"//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/679XxlbqAe2s4xWAG1oXse/211a4fa7f9eebce0d2aef01c3e727a53/sleeping.jpg?w=750&h=549&q=50&fm=webp 750w,\n//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/679XxlbqAe2s4xWAG1oXse/211a4fa7f9eebce0d2aef01c3e727a53/sleeping.jpg?w=1500&h=1098&q=50&fm=webp 1500w,\n//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/679XxlbqAe2s4xWAG1oXse/211a4fa7f9eebce0d2aef01c3e727a53/sleeping.jpg?w=3000&h=2197&q=50&fm=webp 3000w","sizes":"(max-width: 3000px) 100vw, 3000px"}},"date":"2019-12-06","id":"24d6437c-dc6b-5145-9a7a-156a5ecd35e0","content":{"json":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"I'm not someone to make a big deal out of things (or at least I don't think I am), I'm still pretty young so I'm sure there are loads of people that have felt this far worse than me but I just feel like I've been working my ass off for well, as long as I can remember, going from school to University and then straight into a job. That's the case for so many people, I can't have been the only person that just felt like they needed a bit of a break.","marks":[],"data":{}}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"paragraph","content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"I mean, I don't help myself either. I seem to find it very hard to say ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"No","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" to people asking me to work on projects with them or to make them a website, logo or whatever it is. I always try to put in 100% effort in whatever I'm doing as well. Juggling all of my University work alongside the various projects and startups really took it's toll on me. I remember often waking up to go into campus for a lecture or two only to come back home, sleep, eat and then go back to bed. And repeat.","marks":[],"data":{}}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"paragraph","content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"I've mentioned it before but when I graduated from University my plan was to take a break for a while to tackle this, work on my own projects and maybe even start something of my own. But then the Silicon Valley oppurtunity came up and that was just something I couldn't pass up. The intensity and hours in the work out in the US 🇺🇸 was just next level and really didn't help at all. Most of my time I just felt burnt out and probably didn't enjoy work as much as I could have as a result of this.","marks":[],"data":{}}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"paragraph","content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Since I've been back from my year in America, I've finally taken that \"break\" and I feel good. A lot fresher, a lot more energised. Like I just needed to re-charge the batteries. I put \"break\" in quotes because I've still been freelancing, working on some of my own projects and startups. One of course has been a new Podcast, ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The Third Wheel","marks":[],"data":{}}],"data":{"uri":"https://thethirdwheel.fm/"}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" - which has been super enjoyable to do (go check it out if you haven't). Cheeky plug.","marks":[],"data":{}}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","content":[],"data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"l62l9fcffwik","contentful_id":"l62l9fcffwik"}},"id":"c2rm3GGg4C9kFHDjbMT3EHo","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2020-04-19T14:44:28.300Z","updatedAt":"2020-04-19T14:44:28.300Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment","contentful_id":"master"}},"revision":1,"contentful_id":"2rm3GGg4C9kFHDjbMT3EHo"},"fields":{"title":{"en-US":"The Third Wheel Banner"},"file":{"en-US":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/2rm3GGg4C9kFHDjbMT3EHo/099689d38d8e83ceb221b90b25e8403d/image.png","details":{"size":4685392,"image":{"width":3280,"height":1440}},"fileName":"image.png","contentType":"image/png"}}}}}},{"nodeType":"paragraph","content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Please don't take any this as me moaning or complaining, it's more of just an observation or feeling. I don't like complaining about anything really, I just like to get on with things and thinking back about all of this now as I write this, I wouldn't even change much if anything. There also isn't any deeper meaning to me saying I was tired, like any mental health struggles of feeling low about life. I was just tired lol. Anyway I'm waffling, what I'm really trying to get at is I think a lot of people understimate how much us \"young-uns\" actually work these days and even though we're young we still get tired. It might just be good to take a bit of a break. I'm not saying sit on your ass all day watching netflix but you know, if you're not exactly happy with your work or you're feeling a bit burnt-out it might be a good thing. I think it has been for me. We live in a world where everyone thinks you must be moving forward all the time, but maybe standing still for a little while could could mean you move forward at a quicker pace in the future. Oooo I like that line.","marks":[],"data":{}}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","content":[],"data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"l62l9fcffwik","contentful_id":"l62l9fcffwik"}},"id":"c4SEyFuDxpTZdRXIr0jykhl","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2020-04-19T14:45:05.564Z","updatedAt":"2020-04-19T14:45:05.564Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment","contentful_id":"master"}},"revision":1,"contentful_id":"4SEyFuDxpTZdRXIr0jykhl"},"fields":{"title":{"en-US":"We were on a break! GIF"},"file":{"en-US":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/4SEyFuDxpTZdRXIr0jykhl/d83020a45248291d0b2d22c4ba295f0c/image.png","details":{"size":135167,"image":{"width":480,"height":270}},"fileName":"image.png","contentType":"image/png"}}}}}},{"nodeType":"paragraph","content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Have a break, have a kitkat,","marks":[],"data":{}}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"paragraph","content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Aaron","marks":[],"data":{}}],"data":{}}]},"fields":{"readingTime":{"text":"3 min read"}}}},"signatureLight":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/png;base64,","aspectRatio":0.9345794392523364,"src":"/static/a56bb448c38ea4d2f901a14c780c899a/169d0/signature-light.png","srcSet":"/static/a56bb448c38ea4d2f901a14c780c899a/69585/signature-light.png 200w,\n/static/a56bb448c38ea4d2f901a14c780c899a/169d0/signature-light.png 259w","sizes":"(max-width: 259px) 100vw, 259px"}}},"signatureDark":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/png;base64,","aspectRatio":0.9345794392523364,"src":"/static/a6a6e226b6a5f5dee489972d46f53256/169d0/signature-dark.png","srcSet":"/static/a6a6e226b6a5f5dee489972d46f53256/69585/signature-dark.png 200w,\n/static/a6a6e226b6a5f5dee489972d46f53256/169d0/signature-dark.png 259w","sizes":"(max-width: 259px) 100vw, 259px"}}},"avatar":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","aspectRatio":1,"src":"/static/ae9d5416402310a01aa837eaae5d9691/49b36/avatar.jpg","srcSet":"/static/ae9d5416402310a01aa837eaae5d9691/f836f/avatar.jpg 200w,\n/static/ae9d5416402310a01aa837eaae5d9691/2244e/avatar.jpg 400w,\n/static/ae9d5416402310a01aa837eaae5d9691/49b36/avatar.jpg 512w","sizes":"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px"}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"taking-a-break"}},"staticQueryHashes":["3574470190","3574470190"]}